---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 34,
  title: 'Day 34',
  date: '2026-10-9',
  description: 'I got a lock for my bike, AZS',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today,I had 4h of lessons planned but It taked only 1h, after that I
          washed my clothes and after this I found a lock to my new bike, so I
          needed to ride 10km to get it, and get back, I made pasta(it was
          great), and becouse I ate too much I went to sleep for a moment
          becouse I had AZS planned for today, Idk why but only 4 people were
          there, 4 with me , and trainer was absent, I thought the lvl of AZS
          could be weak but not like this, I destroyed everyone with my left
          hand, after training I invited my friend to AZS, maybe she'll join and
          I was writing with my friends, and with my first participant in Lodz,
          I also corrected my poster. not long after I went sleep
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I want to print and laminate my poster, and hang it on the hall wall at
        least 2 , I also have training at 19;30, and I need to learn her at
        least how to serve, becouse she want to learn this, I need to buy some
        food, and I want to create a site for badminton, but before that I need
        to end course I started earlier.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 3/10, Idk why but I was tired all day, so I couldn't
          motivate my body to do something, but It wasn't a bad day
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={3} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
